// OtherCreatureYouControl = "other creature you control" ([CR#613.6] anthem
// shape) as a reusable Predicate atom — the filter half of the
// OtherCreaturesYouControl selection wrapper, split out so other card text
// (e.g. singular references, non-`Each` uses) can nest it too.
(
    name: "OtherCreatureYouControl",
    template: "other creature you control",
    kinds: [Predicate],
    body: And([Creature, Not(Ref(This)), ControlledBy(Ref(You))]),
)
